            "review_title": "Review at Quan Bia Lam Hang",
            "review_text": "Leonhkny\nHong Kong, China29703 contributions\n0\nLate night Hanoi\nJan 2023\nThis is a typical local streetside restaurant in Hanoi. Close to many spas, it is a popular late light place. Menu, which is in Vietnamese only, includes meat, seafood and grain options. Taste is surprisingly on the mild side. Price is dirt cheap. If hygiene is not a major concern, this is an interesting choice.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 16, 2023",
